<title>UK: Freddie Mac adds $100 million to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adds $100 million to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and Nomura has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT   *$600 MLN	COUPON     6.70 PCT  MATURITY    05.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE 100.877988 PAY DATE  **19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER   100.877988 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR $500 MLN ON 07.JAN.97</p>
<p>		 FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING DEAL</p>
<p>		**PLUS 35 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
